{
  "file": "module2",
  "page": 46,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        67.39069366455078,
        527.3464965820312,
        81.83369445800781
      ],
      "text": "screening tools are presented in the operational handbook, including modelled performance of",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        77.79670715332031,
        527.4463500976562,
        95.03370666503906
      ],
      "text": "(7) accuracy and yield . While all of the screening tools presented are recommended for all people",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        93.79071807861328,
        527.4268188476562,
        108.23371887207031
      ],
      "text": "living with HIV for ease of programming, evidence showed notable accuracy of CRP for TB screening",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        106.99073028564453,
        527.4497680664062,
        121.43373107910156
      ],
      "text": "in people not yet receiving ART and that CXR enhanced the sensitivity of the W4SS among people",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        120.19074249267578,
        427.63250732421875,
        134.6337432861328
      ],
      "text": "receiving ART, both of which might be considered when choosing algorithms.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        141.8946075439453,
        527.1608276367188,
        156.3376007080078
      ],
      "text": "Among inpatients on medical wards in settings with a high TB burden, evidence showed that the W4SS,",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.94873046875,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        155.09474182128906,
        527.450927734375,
        169.53773498535156
      ],
      "text": "CRP and CXR had limited accuracy, either due to extremely low specificity or suboptimal sensitivity.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        168.29469299316406,
        527.364990234375,
        182.73768615722656
      ],
      "text": "Therefore, using mWRD as an upfront screening and diagnostic test is warranted, particularly given",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        181.4947052001953,
        301.472412109375,
        195.9376983642578
      ],
      "text": "the urgency of timely diagnosis in this population.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        203.19862365722656,
        527.446533203125,
        217.64161682128906
      ],
      "text": "While there are minimal data on optimal frequency of screening across all tools, data presented to",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        216.3986358642578,
        527.4387817382812,
        230.8416290283203
      ],
      "text": "the GDG on results from the WHIP3TB trial (evaluating the effectiveness of weekly rifapentine plus",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        229.59864807128906,
        527.4443359375,
        244.04164123535156
      ],
      "text": "isoniazid for 3 months compared with periodic rifapentine plus isoniazid for 3 months and 6 months",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        240.0045928955078,
        527.4351196289062,
        257.2416076660156
      ],
      "text": "(79) of daily isoniazid in HIV-positive individuals)   underscored the need for more intensified routine",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        255.9987335205078,
        527.4475708007812,
        270.4417419433594
      ],
      "text": "screening in addition to the W4SS, even among those receiving ART who have received TPT. The",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        269.1986083984375,
        527.4169311523438,
        283.6416320800781
      ],
      "text": "GDG suggested that conducting more intensified screening in addition to the W4SS should occur",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        282.39862060546875,
        527.3839721679688,
        296.8416442871094
      ],
      "text": "at the time of an initial diagnosis of HIV or during the first antenatal care visit for pregnant women,",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        295.5986328125,
        527.3936767578125,
        310.0416564941406
      ],
      "text": "and then annually thereafter. To reduce the burden on the patient, screening should be aligned with",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        308.798583984375,
        527.4113159179688,
        323.2416076660156
      ],
      "text": "other routine HIV care visits, such as those for viral load monitoring or for ruling out TB disease prior",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        321.99859619140625,
        527.4090576171875,
        336.4416198730469
      ],
      "text": "to initiating TPT, depending on the setting and the national guidelines on HIV. Where applicable,",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        335.1986083984375,
        527.3914794921875,
        349.6416320800781
      ],
      "text": "the W4SS should also be conducted as part of a comprehensive clinical evaluation and to inform",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        348.39862060546875,
        527.3958129882812,
        362.8416442871094
      ],
      "text": "the need for increased infection control and for other diagnostic tests, such as LF-LAM. Otherwise",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        361.5986022949219,
        527.4344482421875,
        376.0416259765625
      ],
      "text": "screening with the W4SS alone should be carried out during all other interactions between patients",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        374.7986145019531,
        186.0999298095703,
        389.24163818359375
      ],
      "text": "and health care workers.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        396.5025939941406,
        527.4212646484375,
        410.94561767578125
      ],
      "text": "Consideration should also be given to the added benefit of including CRP for ruling out TB disease",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        409.7025146484375,
        527.4322509765625,
        424.1455383300781
      ],
      "text": "prior to initiating TPT among people living with HIV. In a setting of 1% TB prevalence, among 1 000",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        422.9026184082031,
        527.5934448242188,
        437.34564208984375
      ],
      "text": "outpatients screened with the W4SS followed by CRP, 742 would be true negatives and eligible for TPT",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.970259666442871,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        436.10260009765625,
        527.453125,
        450.5456237792969
      ],
      "text": "compared with only 416 found eligible by the W4SS. As is the case for using CXR for ruling out TB",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        449.3025207519531,
        527.5799560546875,
        463.74554443359375
      ],
      "text": "disease prior to initiating TPT, restricted access to CRP or CXR should not be a barrier to initiating TPT.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.985740661621094,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        471.0065002441406,
        527.435546875,
        485.44952392578125
      ],
      "text": "When considering using an mWRD as a TB screening tool among people living with HIV, it should",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        484.2065124511719,
        527.3638305664062,
        498.6495361328125
      ],
      "text": "be ensured that universal access to mWRD as a diagnostic test for everyone with presumptive",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        497.406494140625,
        527.3543090820312,
        511.8495178222656
      ],
      "text": "TB is achieved first. The use of an mWRD as a screening tool requires significant resources for",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        510.60650634765625,
        527.1417236328125,
        525.0494995117188
      ],
      "text": "implementation, including increased capacity for diagnostic networks and expansion of sample",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        523.8065185546875,
        527.552001953125,
        538.24951171875
      ],
      "text": "transportation networks. Depending on the feasibility and resources available, countries may choose",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.999099731445312,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        537.0064697265625,
        527.2885131835938,
        551.449462890625
      ],
      "text": "to prioritize TB screening using mWRDs among certain subpopulations, such as medical inpatients in",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.994098663330078,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        550.20654296875,
        527.433349609375,
        564.6495361328125
      ],
      "text": "settings where the TB prevalence is less than 10%, among other patients who are acutely unwell or",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        563.406494140625,
        527.4068603515625,
        577.8494873046875
      ],
      "text": "among pregnant women living with HIV. Screening with an mWRD in lower prevalence settings than",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        576.6065063476562,
        527.3762817382812,
        591.0494995117188
      ],
      "text": "those included in the IPD meta-analysis may result in higher false positives should the diagnosis not",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        589.8065185546875,
        527.4266967773438,
        604.24951171875
      ],
      "text": "be confirmed, with the associated overtreatment and related social and economic consequences,",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        603.0064697265625,
        527.4046630859375,
        617.449462890625
      ],
      "text": "including potential delays in starting ART. Careful clinical assessment is recommended to ensure that",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        616.20654296875,
        527.3850708007812,
        630.6495361328125
      ],
      "text": "TB is the primary cause of illness and that other conditions leading to the clinical presentation are",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        629.406494140625,
        527.4036254882812,
        643.8494873046875
      ],
      "text": "also managed. A negative mWRD does not exclude TB. Patients in such settings who are mWRD",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        642.6065063476562,
        527.38818359375,
        657.0494995117188
      ],
      "text": "negative but are manifestly sick may not be able to produce sputum of sufficient quality or may have",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        655.8065185546875,
        527.4530029296875,
        670.24951171875
      ],
      "text": "extrapulmonary TB. For patients with a history of TB within the past 5 years, a positive result may be",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        669.0064697265625,
        527.434326171875,
        683.449462890625
      ],
      "text": "due to the presence of DNA detected from previously treated TB. Should the patient be unable to",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        679.4125366210938,
        527.3618774414062,
        696.6495361328125
      ],
      "text": "(69) provide sputum, other biological specimens should be considered, as indicated  . The TB prevalence",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 10.948379516601562,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        695.406494140625,
        527.4563598632812,
        709.8494873046875
      ],
      "text": "among people living with HIV in medical wards may be calculated as the percentage of people with",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        708.6065063476562,
        440.93609619140625,
        723.0494995117188
      ],
      "text": "HIV-related admissions during a 6–12-month period who are diagnosed with TB.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        730.3104248046875,
        527.3904418945312,
        744.75341796875
      ],
      "text": "To inform programming and resource planning, countries are encouraged to monitor and evaluate",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        743.5103759765625,
        476.1774597167969,
        757.953369140625
      ],
      "text": "the yield of TB screening among people living with HIV, disaggregated by screening tool.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        796.217041015625,
        136.43409729003906,
        806.7210083007812
      ],
      "text": "WHO consolidated",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        136.43649291992188,
        796.217041015625,
        170.0604705810547,
        806.7210083007812
      ],
      "text": "guidelines",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        172.25680541992188,
        796.217041015625,
        226.65042114257812,
        806.7210083007812
      ],
      "text": "on tuberculosis:",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        41.23320007324219,
        801.0170288085938,
        49.47319793701172,
        811.52099609375
      ],
      "text": "34",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        805.8170166015625,
        219.03489685058594,
        816.3209838867188
      ],
      "text": "systematic screening for tuberculosis disease",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    }
  ]
}